{"id":"ccbc12:problem:c-p1957","answer":"CONAN DOYLE","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>视频31秒后每个动作代表一个字母。加密方式可以参见福尔摩斯探案集。</p>","text":"视频31秒后每个动作代表一个字母。加密方式可以参见福尔摩斯探案集。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"有小姐姐的联系方式吗","html":"<p>有的！</p>","text":"有的！","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>把视频中31-44秒以及59-74秒钟的动作，按照《福尔摩斯》里的跳舞的人密码转成字母：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-cbd6c10a6b25c329b0d5439e\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-1957-1.png\"/></p>\n<p>虚线为未在原著中出现的字母</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-30d57e370bc1e5f99a8449b0\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-1957-2.png\"/></p>\n<p>原著中字母N的左臂是伸直的\n但是网上能搜到的大部分对照表都是弯曲的\n好在不影响识别</p>\n<p>转换后可得到答案：<strong>CONAN DOYLE</strong>。</p>","text":"把视频中31-44秒以及59-74秒钟的动作，按照《福尔摩斯》里的跳舞的人密码转成字母：\n\n虚线为未在原著中出现的字母\n\n原著中字母N的左臂是伸直的\n但是网上能搜到的大部分对照表都是弯曲的\n好在不影响识别\n\n转换后可得到答案：\nCONAN DOYLE\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-30d57e370bc1e5f99a8449b0","asset-cbd6c10a6b25c329b0d5439e"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-30d57e370bc1e5f99a8449b0","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-1957-2.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-1957-2.png","mime":"image/png","size":413761,"sha256":"c80ed2af07fb10fa45bb29dd75b420b044fff01dee4fbf92f2b1a0474473c872","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-cbd6c10a6b25c329b0d5439e","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-1957-1.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/c-1957-1.png","mime":"image/png","size":116459,"sha256":"889eadd12bd8d8c2484b4ec9a55e0971e308a8e5839106dcffe53040223ebc16","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
